.nytimes.com/2016/11/30/arts/dance/nancy-meehan-died.html', 'snippet': 'Tall and striking, combining sensuous grace with nuanced force, Ms. Meehan came to notice as a leading soloist in the Erick Hawkins troupe in the 1960s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nancy Meehan, a highly original choreographer and dancer whose evocative, plotless works on nature themes found a special place amid opposing trends in experimental dance after the 1960s, died on Nov. 23 in Manhattan. She was 85.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/01/arts/01MEEHAN-obit/30MEEHAN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/01/arts/01MEEHAN-obit/30MEEHAN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/01/arts/01MEEHAN-obit/30MEEHAN-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/01/arts/01MEEHAN-obit/30NEEHAN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 463, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/01/arts/01MEEHAN-obit/30NEEHAN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 463}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/01/arts/01MEEHAN-obit/30NEEHAN-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 791, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/01/arts/01MEEHAN-obit/30NEEHAN-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1582, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Nancy Meehan, 85, Evocative Dancer and Choreographer, Dies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nancy Meehan, 85, Evocative Choreographer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Meehan, Nancy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-01T02:23:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anna Kisselgoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kisselgoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea32b718-db72-5c52-824f-5194b0e49f8a', 'word_count': 543, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea32b718-db72-5c52-824f-5194b0e49f8a'}, {'abstract': 'Chris McCullough’s dual career with two Brooklyn teams is unusual, but a split existence is not. 45 N.B.A. players have been assigned on 103 occasions this season to D-League stints.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/30/sports/basketball/chris-mccullough-nets-d-league-nba.html', 'snippet': 'Chris McCullough’s dual career with two Brooklyn teams is unusual, but a split existence is not. 45 N.B.A. players have been assigned on 103 occasions this season to D-League stints.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s good to be 21 years old: no aches, no existential crises. After scoring 22 points in nearly 35 minutes of playing time on Tuesday afternoon for the Long Island Nets of the N.B.A. Development League, Chris McCullough stretched his muscles on a foam roll, iced his knees, soaked in a hot tub, ate a snack and took a nap. McCullough then changed locker rooms and uniforms inside Barclays Center in order to be ready for a game with the Brooklyn Nets at 7:30 that evening.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/01/sports/basketball/01netscombo/01netscombo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/01/sports/basketball/01netscombo/01netscombo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/01/sports/basketball/01netscombo/01netscombo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/01/sports/basketball/01netscombo/01netscombo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1355, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/01/sports/basketball/01netscombo/01netscombo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/01/sports/basketball/01netscombo/01netscombo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/01/sports/basketball/01netscombo/01netscombo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'He Works Day and Night for the Nets. And the Other Nets.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Working Day and Night, for Two Different Teams', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 's