 — The basement room was cleared of pens with blue or black ink, items that could mar paper ballots. Anyone wearing a coat was told to leave it in the hallway, in case something nefarious was hidden underneath. Water bottles, purses and keys were placed on the floor, leaving the large plastic tables smooth and uncluttered.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘We’re Going to Get This Done’: Wisconsin Vote Recount Is Underway', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘We’re Going  to Get This Done’: Wisconsin Starts  Vote Recount', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wisconsin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stein, Jill', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Green Party of the United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Michigan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-01T20:17:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Bosman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bosman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/da450e89-8e68-5995-90dd-fc55310ce332', 'word_count': 1078, 'uri': 'nyt://article/da450e89-8e68-5995-90dd-fc55310ce332'}, {'abstract': 'It’s also a security risk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/01/o