r bones. My co-workers, particularly one person named Stephanie, insist that I can’t prove dragons never existed. If I’m right, please order her to stop bringing up dragons at work.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/04/magazine/04hodgman/04hodgman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/04/magazine/04hodgman/04hodgman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/04/magazine/04hodgman/04hodgman-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/04/magazine/04hodgman/04hodgman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 596, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/04/magazine/04hodgman/04hodgman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 596}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/04/magazine/04hodgman/04hodgman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1017, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/04/magazine/04hodgman/04hodgman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1244, 'width': 1253, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge John Hodgman on the Existence of Dragons', 'kicker': 'Judge John Hodgman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bonus Advice From Judge John Hodgman', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'k