o substantial acclaim and multiple award nominations. Its “deluxe hardcover” reprint will be available as a limited edition of 1,000 copies.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '83', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/04/books/review/1204-BKS-Otherworldly/1204-BKS-Otherworldly-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 906, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/04/books/review/1204-BKS-Otherworldly/1204-BKS-Otherworldly-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 906}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/04/books/review/1204-BKS-Otherworldly/1204-BKS-Otherworldly-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 678, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/04/books/review/1204-BKS-Otherworldly/1204-BKS-Otherworldly-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1385, 'width': 917, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/04/books/review/1204-BKS-Otherworldly/1204-BKS-Otherworldly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/04/books/review/1204-BKS-Otherworldly/1204-BKS-Otherworldly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/04/books/review/1204-BKS-Otherworldly/1204-BKS-Otherworldly-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Latest in Science Fiction and Fantasy', 'kicker':