-ac44-3900d386b917', 'word_count': 223, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7da19f0f-7041-587e-ac44-3900d386b917'}, {'abstract': 'The show will open in 2018 — the museum’s 250th birthday — and bring together Renaissance art and 17th century works from the collection.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/02/arts/design/royal-academy-of-arts-will-stage-show-of-charles-is-collection.html', 'snippet': 'The show will open in 2018 — the museum’s 250th birthday — and bring together Renaissance art and 17th century works from the collection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The Royal Academy of Arts will stage the largest show ever of art from the collection of Charles I, the British king, the museum said on Friday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Royal Academy of Arts Will Stage Show of Charles I’s Collection', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Truly Royal Show', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shea, Christopher D', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Royal Academy of Arts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-02T19:43:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher D. Shea', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/86a24421-79f7-5e52-b286-12a6ec364a0f', 'word_count': 208, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86a24421-79f7-5e52-b286-12a6ec364a0f'}, {'abstract': 'After years quietly supporting U.K. talent — with money, work spaces and more — the designer’s Sarabande Foundation is ready to celebrate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/02/t-magazine/art/sarabande-alexander-mcqueen-art-fashion-reindeer.html', 'snippet': 'After years quietly supporting U.K. talent — with money, work spaces and more — the designer’s Sarabande Foundation is ready to celebrate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a forest of silver birch trees strung with crystal icicles last night, stars of London’s art and fashion scenes gathered alongside recent art-school graduates, posing for photographs in antlered crowns within a set styled like a moonlit Scottish glade. This was the launch night of the Reindeer, a festive, three-day pop-up to celebrate the work of Sarabande, a foundation that supports young people working in the creative industries — and which, until very recently, has kept its activities out of sight.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/02/t-magazine/entertainment/02tmag-sarabande-slide-6K0K/02tmag-sarabande-slide-6K0K-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/02/t-magazine/entertainment/02tmag-sarabande-slide-6K0K/02tmag-sarabande-slide-6K0K-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/02/t-magazine/entertainment/02tmag-sarabande-slide-6K0K/02tmag-sarabande-slide-6K0K-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/02/t-magazine/entertainment/02tmag-sarabande-slide-6K0K/02tmag-sarabande-slide-6K0K-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1393, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, '