732, 'uri': 'nyt://article/54bb332c-a7b6-5811-9ac1-71b98f8d85cd'}, {'abstract': 'Today’s Ask Watching is dedicated to the “Gilmore Girls” revival. So many lingering questions. So, so many.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/02/watching/gilmore-girls-netflix-revival-questions-answered.html', 'snippet': 'Today’s Ask Watching is dedicated to the “Gilmore Girls” revival. So many lingering questions. So, so many.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Welcome back to Ask Watching, where we answer your movie and TV questions. This week, we’re dedicating this space to “Gilmore Girls: A Year in the Life.” You can read our reaction post here. Thanks to everyone who wrote in with questions; the Watching inbox runneth over.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/30/watching/gilmore-girls-watching-55/gilmore-girls-watching-55-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/30/watching/gilmore-girls-watching-55/gilmore-girls-watching-55-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/30/watching/gilmore-girls-watching-55/gilmore-girls-watching-55-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/30/watching/gilmore-girls-watching-55/gilmore-girls-watching-55-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/30/watching/gilmore-girls-watching-55/gilmore-girls-watching-55-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/30/watching/gilmore-girls-watching-55/gilmore-girls-watching-55-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/30/watching/gilmore-girls-watching-55/gilmore-girls-watching-55-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'All Your ‘Gilmore Girls: A Year in the Life’ Questions, Answered', 'kicker': 'Ask Watching', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-12-02T20:04:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Watching', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margaret Lyons', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margaret', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyons', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5cc76a00-87d1-5aeb-8b07-cc732ad3a268', 'word_count': 2598, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5cc76a00-87d1-5aeb-8b07-cc732ad3a268'}, {'abstract': 'In a meeting with directors and artists, the Russian president also defended a court that gave a film director a 20-year prison term.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/02/movies/in-meeting-putin-vows-to-protect-artistic-freedom-in-russia.html', 'snippet': 'In a meeting with directors and artists, the Russian president also defended a court that gave a film director a 20-year prison term.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — President Vladimir V. Putin of Russia, in a meeting with film directors and artists, vowed on Friday to protect artistic freedom in the country but also said a court was right to give one director a 20-year prison term.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headlin