ton-wants-to-help.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Huffington is trying to change people’s notions of sleep with her new company, Thrive Global.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Arianna Huffington has a lot to say about sleep, but not because she has lost any since Election Day. The fact that Donald J. Trump won the presidential election last month — and as a candidate called her a “dummy” and a “liberal clown” on Twitter — has not kept her up at night, brooding and anxious about government of the big league, by the big league and for the big league. (Or the bigly.)', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/nyregion/05grace1/05grace1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/05/nyregion/05grace1/05grace1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/nyregion/05grace1/05grace1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/nyregion/05grace1/05grace1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/05/nyregion/05grace1/05grace1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/nyregion/05grace1/05grace1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/nyregion/05grace1/