and the Raiders proved they are the team to beat in the A.F.C. Here’s what happened.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/04/sports/nfl-scores-schedule-patriots.html', 'snippet': 'In Week 13, a superstar was benched, a 2-point interception won a game, and the Raiders proved they are the team to beat in the A.F.C. Here’s what happened.', 'lead_paragraph': '■ Apparently, nobody is above team dress codes, even the reigning M.V.P. Panthers quarterback Cam Newton was benched for one series for not wearing a tie on the team’s flight to Seattle. His one-snap replacement threw the ball to the wrong team, however, putting the Panthers in a hole they could not dig out of.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/sports/nflbriefing-cooper/nflbriefing-cooper-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/05/sports/nflbriefing-cooper/nflbriefing-cooper-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/sports/nflbriefing-cooper/nflbriefing-cooper-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/sports/nflbriefing-cooper/nflbriefing-cooper-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/05/sports/nflbriefing-cooper/nflbriefing-cooper-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/sports/nflbriefing-cooper/nflbriefing-cooper-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width':