n-his-sound.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Brown, a country singer whose self-titled debut album was recently released, performed at Irving Plaza on Saturday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During the middle of his concert Saturday night at Irving Plaza, the young country singer Kane Brown told a story about meeting one of his idols, Randy Travis. Mr. Travis has one of the most convincing, haunting voices in the genre, and has been a model of stoic dignity for the last couple of decades. When they met, Mr. Brown said he asked Mr. Travis for a hug.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/arts/05KANEBROWN/05KANEBROWN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/05/arts/05KANEBROWN/05KANEBROWN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/arts/05KANEBROWN/05KANEBROWN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/arts/05KANEBROWN/05KANEBROWN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/05/arts/05KANEBROWN/05KANEBROWN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/arts/05KANEBROWN/05KANEBROWN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/arts/05KANEBROWN