}, {'abstract': 'William Sallie may die soon because he missed a court deadline by eight days. Confined to death row, he had no lawyer before his appeal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/05/opinion/georgias-dangerous-rush-to-execution.html', 'snippet': 'William Sallie may die soon because he missed a court deadline by eight days. Confined to death row, he had no lawyer before his appeal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tomorrow, the State of Georgia intends to execute William Sallie, who was convicted of killing a man in 1990. It would be Georgia’s ninth execution this year, a modern state record and nearly twice the previous high-water mark of five executions, set first in 1987 and again in 2015.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/opinion/05fletcherWeb/05fletcherWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/05/opinion/05fletcherWeb/05fletcherWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/opinion/05fletcherWeb/05fletcherWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 738, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/opinion/05fletcherWeb/05fletcherWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1476, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/05/opinion/05fletcherWeb/05fletcherWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/05/opinion/05fletcherWeb/05fletcherWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumb