bstantial grief and her weakened physical strength made the challenge seem impossible at times.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/05/nyregion/despite-cancer-diagnosis-and-husbands-death-keeping-a-positive-outlook.html', 'snippet': 'Gertrudis Torres said her son and daughter have given her motivation to beat the disease, even as her substantial grief and her weakened physical strength made the challenge seem impossible at times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Recalling that moment four years ago, when Gertrudis Torres learned she had Stage 3 breast cancer, still causes her breathing to become heavy and tears to well up. The unthinkable diagnosis was another blow to Ms. Torres’s family. Two years before, in 2010, her husband, Pedro Ayala, was told that he had throat cancer.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/06/nyregion/06neediesttorres/06neediesttorres-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/06/nyregion/06neediesttorres/06neediesttorres-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/06/nyregion/06neediesttorres/06neediesttorres-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/06/nyregion/06neediesttorres/06neediesttorres-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/06/nyregion/06neediesttorres/06neediesttorres-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'c