e': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Credits, Deductions and Exemptions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mnuchin, Steven T', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-06T08:21:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Leonhardt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leonhardt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/89a34323-d5db-5acf-8f62-c522d51bba26', 'word_count': 812, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89a34323-d5db-5acf-8f62-c522d51bba26'}, {'abstract': 'There are many headphones for sale with different noise levels, but an audiologist helped The Times create a safe experiment with a common model of headphones.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/06/health/how-loud-are-your-apple-iphone-headphones.html', 'snippet': 'There are many headphones for sale with different noise levels, but an audiologist helped The Times create a safe experiment with a common model of headphones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many models of headphones make varying claims about reducing the noise your ears are exposed to. With the help of an audiologist, The New York Times has put together this experiment to demonstrate how much sound your ears may be picking up when you listen to music over headphones.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/06/science/06testyourheadphones/06testyourheadphones-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/