', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f725e4b-20d6-50f8-bce6-5e7e1621847c', 'word_count': 1353, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f725e4b-20d6-50f8-bce6-5e7e1621847c'}, {'abstract': 'After reading the job duties and background information for each person selected for a cabinet or staff position, tell us what you think.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/06/learning/what-are-your-reactions-to-president-elect-trumps-cabinet-appointments.html', 'snippet': 'After reading the job duties and background information for each person selected for a cabinet or staff position, tell us what you think.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From George Washington’s presidency until today, the president of the United States has always had a cabinet, a group of close advisers who help him make decisions about how to run the country. Since winning the election, President-elect Donald J. Trump has named many of the individuals he will nominate to serve as members of his cabinet.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/24/us/00carson-hfo/24carson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/24/us/00carson-hfo/24carson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/24/us/00carson-hfo/24carson-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/24/us/00carson-hfo/24carson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/24/us/00carson-hfo/24carson-articleLarge.jpg', '