y says the saved jobs in Indiana are likely to fall to automation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/06/us/politics/donald-trump-transition.html', 'snippet': 'The president-elect will meet with tech chief executives next week. Meantime, the C.E.O. of Carrier’s parent company says the saved jobs in Indiana are likely to fall to automation.', 'lead_paragraph': '■ President-elect Donald J. Trump plans a technology conference next week with high-profile business executives, many of whom opposed his campaign.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/06/us/06transitionbriefing2/06transitionbriefing2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/06/us/06transitionbriefing2/06transitionbriefing2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/06/us/06transitionbriefing2/06transitionbriefing2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/06/us/06transitionbriefing2/06transitionbriefing2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/06/us/06transitionbriefing2/06transitionbriefing2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/06/us/06transitionbriefing2/06transitionbriefing2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'ima