{'abstract': 'For the writer, a good bookstore in a faraway place is as basic a need as a decent hotel, a hot shower and enough underwear.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/06/travel/travel-books-bookstores.html', 'snippet': 'For the writer, a good bookstore in a faraway place is as basic a need as a decent hotel, a hot shower and enough underwear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Years ago, while I was in Antigua with my family, disaster struck. I ran out of good books. This was before the age of Kindle, so I didn’t have the download option, but even if I’d had it, books via pixels aren’t for me. I need the real thing: a solid slab that I can hold in my hands.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/travel/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/11/travel/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/travel/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/travel/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1042, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/11/travel/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1042}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/travel/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES/11ESSAYBOOKSTORES-jumbo.jpg', 