unt': 150, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f639b26-6149-5937-b7c1-58547aad95a0'}, {'abstract': 'Lalas, who won a Major League Soccer title as a player and covered many as a broadcaster, says the diversity of the United States can pose challenges to its style of soccer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/09/sports/soccer/alexi-lalas-mls-hair-american-soccer.html', 'snippet': 'Lalas, who won a Major League Soccer title as a player and covered many as a broadcaster, says the diversity of the United States can pose challenges to its style of soccer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alexi Lalas won one Major League Soccer title as a player and has seen many more as a broadcaster. On Saturday night, when Toronto F.C. hosts the Seattle Sounders in the M.L.S. Cup, he will watch another in his role as an analyst for Fox Sports. This past week, before heading to Toronto, Lalas sat down with a group of New York Times editors to discuss M.L.S., Bruce Arena and just what American soccer is, and what it can be.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/sports/11LALAS1/11LALAS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/11/sports/11LALAS1/11LALAS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/sports/11LALAS1/11LALAS1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/sports/11LALAS1/11LALAS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/11/sports/11L