: '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/3669f954-ac83-572c-8d84-67ad49e3a719', 'word_count': 886, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3669f954-ac83-572c-8d84-67ad49e3a719'}, {'abstract': 'Jesus never said to love the poor as long as they didn’t make bad lifestyle choices.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/10/opinion/his-sign-said-please-help-so-i-tried.html', 'snippet': 'Jesus never said to love the poor as long as they didn’t make bad lifestyle choices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Urbana, Ill. — This is not for the companionship of ladies,” I tell Wes, handing over two $20 bills. I’m breaking one of my own rules. If I give him money, it’s his. He can have himself a big old party if he wants.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/11thompson/11thompson-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/11thompson/11thompson-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/11thompson/11thompson-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/11thompson/11thompson-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/11thompson/11thompson-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/