’s president, Mr. Trump said the United States was not bound by the One China policy, a 44-year diplomatic understanding.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/11/us/politics/trump-taiwan-one-china.html', 'snippet': 'Defending his recent phone call with Taiwan’s president, Mr. Trump said the United States was not bound by the One China policy, a 44-year diplomatic understanding.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President-elect Donald J. Trump, defending his recent phone call with Taiwan’s president, asserted in an interview broadcast on Sunday that the United States was not bound by the One China policy, the 44-year diplomatic understanding that underpins America’s relationship with its biggest rival.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump Suggests Using Bedrock China Policy as Bargaining Chip', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Defending Taiwan Call, Trump Suggests U.S. Isn’t Bound by Longtime China Policy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Landler, Mark', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Taiwan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tsai Ing-wen', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-11T19:37:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Landler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organiza