ie)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-12T14:20:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57e7b054-1938-5a38-8449-f1310e17715f', 'word_count': 1220, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57e7b054-1938-5a38-8449-f1310e17715f'}, {'abstract': 'The new ambassador, the Marquis of Dufferin and Ava, was previously posted in India, Canada, Russia and Egypt.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/12/12/queen-of-england-appoints-new-ambassador-to-paris/', 'snippet': 'The new ambassador, the Marquis of Dufferin and Ava, was previously posted in India, Canada, Russia and Egypt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is officially stated that the Queen has been pleased to approve the appointment of His Excellency the Marquis of Dufferin and Ava as Her Majesty’s Ambassador in Paris. The new Ambassador is a man of the widest diplomatic experience, and in every respect qualified to fill the important post to which he has been appointed. As far back as 1860 he was sent to Smyrna as British Commissioner to inquire into the massacre of Christians there. In 1864 he was Under-Secretary of State for India. In 1872 Mr. Glad\xadstone appointed him Governor-General of Canada, and he filled the office till 1878.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/12/blogs/12olddec-1891-ambassador/12olddec-1891-ambassador-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/12/blogs/12olddec-1891-ambassador/12olddec-1891-ambassador-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, '