’s nods feel less adventurous.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/12/arts/television/golden-globes-2017-tv-snubs-and-surprises.html', 'snippet': 'The Globes have a recent history of confounding expectations and latching on to buzzy new shows. This year’s nods feel less adventurous.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Golden Globes have a recent history of confounding expectations (“Mozart in the Jungle”) and latching on to buzzy new shows (“Mr. Robot”) in their TV nominations. This year’s nods feel less adventurous. Even though four new shows made the field for drama series, none of them was unexpected. With so much new TV to process all the time, it becomes more difficult for existing series to break through the chatter. Witness “Mr. Robot,” gone from the drama nominees after winning in its first season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/13/arts/13globessnub-tv1/13globessnub-tv1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/13/arts/13globessnub-tv1/13globessnub-tv1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/13/arts/13globessnub-tv1/13globessnub-tv1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/13/arts/13globessnub-tv1/13globessnub-tv1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 430, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/13/arts/13globessnub-tv1/13globessnub-tv1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 430}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',