 in the international rule of law. Demagogues run it down at great risk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/12/opinion/dont-caricature-europes-court.html', 'snippet': 'The European Court of Human Rights is a remarkable success in the international rule of law. Demagogues run it down at great risk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'STRASBOURG, France — Europe is entering a big election year. In 2017, voters in a range of countries, including France, Germany, the Netherlands and now possibly Italy, will go to the polls. We can expect campaigns fought on stark battle lines. Austerity policies and immigration will feature. So will the role of European institutions.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/13jagland-inyt/13jagland-inyt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/13jagland-inyt/13jagland-inyt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/13jagland-inyt/13jagland-inyt-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/13jagland-inyt/13jagland-inyt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/13jagland-inyt/13jagland-inyt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/13jagland-inyt/13jagland-inyt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/opinion/sunday/13jagland-inyt/13jagland-inyt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Don’t Caricature Europe’s Court', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Don’t reject Europe court  as caricature', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Court of Human Rights', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-12T15:48:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thorbjorn Jagland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thorbjorn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jagland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd5cb3b2-9c03-586f-8dc9-1da5d5e5de41', 'word_count': 952, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd5cb3b2-9c03-586f-8dc9-1da5d5e5de41'}, {'abstract': 'Approximately 51 million Americans have overactive bladders. Exercises and medications can help, experts say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/12/well/live/when-bathroom-runs-rule-the-day-and-night.html', 'snippet': 'Approximately 51 million Americans have overactive bladders. Exercises and medications can help, experts say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have only one regret about not having been born a male, and it concerns plumbing, namely how easy it is for men to eliminate liquid waste, whether by avoiding long bathroom lines or being able to relieve themselves discreetly when no facility is available. My male envy grew after I contracted poison ivy on unmentionable parts w