://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/12/dining/caviar-chiller-simon-pearce.html', 'snippet': 'This new glass serving dish keeps caviar cold without making a puddle of melted ice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To serve caviar properly, you need to deal with a bed of crushed ice, which can get sloppy as it melts. This new two-piece handblown glass caviar dish from Simon Pearce makes it easy, keeping the ice neatly on the bottom to maintain the chill. A one- to four-ounce tin of precious roe fits in the gently sloped top section. Mother-of-pearl spoons and other accouterments, like a dish for crème fraîche, are up to you. The set is large enough to be deployed for serving a seafood dip, salmon rillettes or smoked fish spread: Bristol Caviar Chiller Set, $100, simonpearce.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/dining/14BURNER-DISH/11BURNER-DISH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/11/dining/14BURNER-DISH/11BURNER-DISH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/dining/14BURNER-DISH/11BURNER-DISH-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/dining/14BURNER-DISH/11BURNER-DISH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/11/dining/14BURNER-DISH/11BURNER-DISH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 604}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/dining/14BURNER-DISH/11BURNER-DISH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1018, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/11/dining/14BURNER-DISH/11BURNER-DISH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2036, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Elegant Solution to Caviar Service', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Chill: An Elegant Solution for Keeping Caviar Cold', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Caviar', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gifts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Simon Pearce Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-12T17:22:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c77604e-5bb6-520b-b74f-0b77c7f0b4e2', 'word_count': 100, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c77604e-5bb6-520b-b74f-0b77c7f0b4e2'}, {'abstract': 'The SoHo pastry chef’s Christmas Morning Cereal returns for a limited engagement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/12/dining/dominique-ansel-bakery-christmas-morning-cereal.html', 'snippet': 'The SoHo pastry chef’s Christmas Morning Cereal returns for a limited engagement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the past few years, the pastry chef Dominique Ansel has been concocting what he calls Christmas Morning Cereal, which can also be sprinkled over ice cream or nibbled on the sly. It resembles the offspring of granola and Cocoa Krispies: a devilish mix of clumps of puffed rice covered in caramelized milk chocolate, candied hazelnuts and meringue drops. It’s available again in Mr. Ansel’s SoHo store, and can be ordered online for pickup and, for that far-flung sweet tooth, for delivery in the continental United States: Christmas Morning Cereal, $15.50 at Dominique Ansel Bakery, 189 Spring Street (Thompson Street), 212-219-2773, or from dominiqueansel.com/christmas-cereal-shipping; orders must be received by Friday for shipping the next Monday, minimum three boxes with a shipping charge of $3 per box.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-CEREAL/14BURNER-CEREAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-CEREAL/14BURNER-CEREAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-CEREAL/14BURNER-CEREAL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-CEREAL/14BURNER-CEREAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 772, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-CEREAL/14BURNER-CEREAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 772}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-CEREAL/14BURNER-CEREAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 796, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20