illes Verot, is the man fashioning these uncommonly beautiful specialties, some glittering in jellied wraps, others revealing kaleidoscope patterns when sliced: Holiday charcuterie, $22 to $99 per pound; regular pâtés, terrines and sausages, $8 to $70 per pound, Le District, Brookfield Place, 225 Liberty Street (West Street), 212-981-8588, ledistrict.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-DISTRICT/14BURNER-DISTRICT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-DISTRICT/14BURNER-DISTRICT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-DISTRICT/14BURNER-DISTRICT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-DISTRICT/14BURNER-DISTRICT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-DISTRICT/14BURNER-DISTRICT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-DISTRICT/14BURNER-DISTRICT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/dining/14BURNER-DISTRICT/14BURNER-DISTRICT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 