 'lead_paragraph': 'Last month’s presidential election exposed the gulf between the technology industry and much of the rest of the country. It put the spotlight on how Silicon Valley tech companies have lived in a bubble in recent years, with job and wealth creation from the industry largely confined to a narrow geographic region around the San Francisco Bay Area.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Daily Report: Google’s Largess Reaches Into the Heartland Unevenly', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oklahoma', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-12T17:53:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pui-Wing Tam', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pui-wing', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tam', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0cf06d3b-28b4-520c-a627-3022e923fcdd', 'word_count': 270, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0cf06d3b-28b4-520c-a627-3022e923fcdd'}, {'abstract': 'The exact cause of the birds’ deaths is unknown, and experts worry that thousands more could be in danger during this year’s migratory season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/12/science/snow-geese-deaths-montana.html', 'snippet': 'The exact cause of the birds’ deaths is unknown, and experts worry that thousands more could be in danger during this year’s migratory season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BUTTE, Mont. — The recent death of thousands of snow geese on a toxic artificial lake here high in the Rocky Mountains once again underscored the devastating environmental legacy of more than a century’s worth of copper mining.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 