elect has targeted businesses for criticism and threatened presidential action.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/12/us/politics/trump-f35-fighter-jet-tweet.html', 'snippet': 'His criticism of the F-35 Joint Strike Fighter, posted on Twitter, continued a pattern in which the president-elect has targeted businesses for criticism and threatened presidential action.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President-elect Donald J. Trump said on Monday that the cost of building the military’s next-generation fighter jet, the F-35 Joint Strike Fighter, had spiraled “out of control,” and he vowed to save billions of dollars on military programs once he enters office next month.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump Joins Line of Critics of Costly Fighter Jet', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trump Is the Latest Critic of F-35 Jet Whose Costs Spiraled ‘Out of Control’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Drew, Christopher', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'F-35 Airplane', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Military Aircraft', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lockheed Martin Corporation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carter, Ashton B', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-12T20:29:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear, Christopher Drew and Isabel Kershner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': N