the buying department at Bloomingdale’s. “I always thought of my sister as being the really creative one in the family. I didn’t see it as my path.” (Her sister, Jaclyn, 33, was a knitwear designer at Proenza Schouler at the time.)', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Brand to Know: an Understated Jewelry Line Made by Sisters', 'kicker': 'On the Verge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jewelry by Sisters', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jewels and Jewelry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Proenza Schouler', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Le Corbusier', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-13T15:55:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hayley Phelan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hayley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Phelan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3934bb2b-aeb7-52bc-9c7a-1bd86f773d07', 'word_count': 537, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3934bb2b-aeb7-52bc-9c7a-1bd86f773d07'}, {'abstract': 'The more President-elect Donald J. Trump stimulates growth, the faster the Federal Reserve is likely to increase rates to avoid overheating the economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/13/business/economy/federal-reserve-interest-rates.html', 'snippet': 'The more President-elect Donald J. Trump stimulates growth, the faster the Federal Reserve is likely to increase rates to avoid overheating the economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Investors in financial markets, and those predicting faster economic growth in 2017, would do well to remember the famous words that William McChesney Martin Jr., the former Federal Reserve chairman, uttered way back in 1955: The Fed’s job is to remove the punch bowl just as the party gets going.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/business/14FED1/14FED1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/14/business/14FED1/14FED1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/business/14FED1/14FED1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/business/14FED1/14FED1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/14/business/14FED1/14FED1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/business/14FED1/14FED1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/business/14FED1/14FED1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1319, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Trump Economic Boom? The Fed May Stand in the Way', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trump’s Aim: Ignite Growth. Fed’s Aim: Prevent Overheating.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Appelbaum, Binyamin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-13T15:56:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Binyamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b6bc64c-00fc-5631-b97b-dda572163da7', 'word_count': 1118, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b6bc64c-00fc-5631-b97b-dda572163da7'}, {'abstract': 'The Greek Chargé d’Affaires in Paris has issued an official regret note to the French government, on behalf of its Greek counterpart.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/12/13/1916-greek-legation-tenders-france-official-regret/', 'snippet': 'The Greek Chargé d’Affaires in Paris has issued an official regret note to the French government, on behalf of its Greek counterpart.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Greek Legation in Paris last night issued the following Note:— “The Greek Chargé d’Affaires has called on the Minister for Foreign Affairs to express to the Government of the French Republic, in the name of the King and the Athens Government, their sincere regret at the events which took place in Athens, which they deplore.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1916: Greek Legation Tenders France Official Regret', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': Non