 great Jim Brown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEST ALLIS, Wis. — President-elect Donald J. Trump said on Tuesday that his nominee for secretary of state, Rex W. Tillerson, would reverse “years of foreign policy blunders and disasters,” and that his close ties to antagonistic foreign leaders — a potential hurdle to his confirmation by the Senate — was one of the reasons he had picked him.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/us/14TRUMP/14TRUMP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/14/us/14TRUMP/14TRUMP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/us/14TRUMP/14TRUMP-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/us/14TRUMP/14TRUMP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/14/us/14TRUMP/14TRUMP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/us/14TRUMP/14TRUMP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/14/us/14TRUMP/14TRUMP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From Kanye West to the Midwest, Donald Trump’s Presidential Reality Show Rolls On', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From Midtown to Midwest, Presidential Reality Show Rolls On', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Landler, Mark', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wisconsin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Paul D Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tillerson, Rex W', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walker, Scott K', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-14T03:43:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Landler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9fd53aa0-9b70-59e2-bc32-2ba278b6e68e', 'word_count': 1047, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9fd53aa0-9b70-59e2-bc32-2ba278b6e68e'}, {'abstract': 'Senators voted for a 20-year cap on federal spending, a cornerstone of President Michel Temer’s plan to restore confidence in the country’s ailing economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/13/world/americas/brazil-protests-senate-austerity-michel-temer.html', 'snippet': 'Senators voted for a 20-year cap on federal spending, a cornerstone of President Michel Temer’s plan to restore confidence in the country’s ailing economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RIO DE JANEIRO — Protests flared in cities around Brazil on Tuesday after the Senate approved a 20-year cap on federal spending, a cornerstone of President Michel Temer’s proposed austerity measures aimed at restoring confidence in the country’s ailing economy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'p