': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — Families, medical workers, insurgent fighters and wounded people were packed and ready Wednesday morning to vacate the ravaged rebel-held neighborhoods of the Syrian city of Aleppo under a deal between Russia and Turkey. Then the resumed booms of incoming artillery shells from pro-government forces sent them into hiding or running for their lives.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Amid Rain of Shells, Aleppo’s Civilians Offer ‘Final Scream’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Amid Rain of Shells, a ‘Final Scream’ From Aleppo’s Civilians', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALEPPO (SYRIA)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evacuations and Evacuees', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALEPPO (SYRIA)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-14T11:16:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anne Barnard and Hwaida Saad', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ba