fc78-aa74-51a6-b0b7-f2be53b051e5'}, {'abstract': 'What was the best thing you ate this year?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/14/dining/your-best-eats-of-2016.html', 'snippet': 'What was the best thing you ate this year?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. For all the good cheer and pine-scented sidewalks, there is something ghostly and wistful about these December days, as we cast our eyes back toward the year that was. Pete Wells wrote about his top 10 restaurants of the year, and about the best dishes he ate for the Food section we blue-bagged and delivered to doors, porches and bushes this morning. (For those dining on the cheap in New York City, Ligaya Mishan offered her own list of bests.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/magazine/06eat-copy1/06mag-06eat-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/06/magazine/06eat-copy1/06mag-06eat-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/magazine/06eat-copy1/06mag-06eat-t_CA0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/magazine/06eat-copy1/06mag-06eat-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/06/magazine/06eat-copy1/06mag-06eat-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/magazine/06eat-copy1/06mag-06eat-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width'