eek season at the Joyce Theater, surveying several decades of its founder’s mesmerizing minimalism. If you missed it — or even if you didn’t — the next best thing is “A Steady Pulse,” an absorbing digital archive published last year by the Pew Center for Arts and Heritage. Late December’s dance lull (various versions of “The Nutcracker” notwithstanding) is the perfect time to dive into this collection, which offers a close look at eight works created by Ms. Childs between 1963 and 1978.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/arts/18GUIDE1/18GUIDE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/18/arts/18GUIDE1/18GUIDE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/arts/18GUIDE1/18GUIDE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/arts/18GUIDE1/18GUIDE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/18/arts/18GUIDE1/18GUIDE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1000}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/arts/18GUIDE1/18GUIDE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 615, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/arts/18GUIDE1/18GUIDE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1229, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'cr