itle': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/b8ad3c2e-4739-5482-b6dd-f340ab25c5de', 'word_count': 723, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b8ad3c2e-4739-5482-b6dd-f340ab25c5de'}, {'abstract': 'The defense rested without calling any witnesses in the trial of Dylann Roof, who is accused of killing nine people in June 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/14/us/dylann-roof-trial-charleston.html', 'snippet': 'The defense rested without calling any witnesses in the trial of Dylann Roof, who is accused of killing nine people in June 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLESTON, S.C. — Polly Sheppard, a 72-year-old retired nurse and longtime stalwart of Emanuel African Methodist Episcopal Church, dived under a table as the gunfire began and did the only thing she could think to do: She prayed aloud. She could see the bullet casings skittering across the floor of the fellowship hall and the young man’s boots approaching. Dylann S. Roof told her to “shut up,” then asked menacingly if he had shot her yet.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/15/us/15ROOF/15ROOF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/15/us/15ROOF/15ROOF-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/15/us/15ROOF/15ROOF-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/15/us/15ROOF/15ROOF-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': '