ion': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/c39ad8d5-c076-5adb-89d2-5cb53d3c10c4', 'word_count': 1044, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c39ad8d5-c076-5adb-89d2-5cb53d3c10c4'}, {'abstract': 'Bernhard Laufer’s lawyer plans to appeal the conviction and sentence on charges including the 2012 stabbing in Kew Gardens Hills of a worshiper.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/14/nyregion/queens-hate-crime-bernhard-laufer.html', 'snippet': 'Bernhard Laufer’s lawyer plans to appeal the conviction and sentence on charges including the 2012 stabbing in Kew Gardens Hills of a worshiper.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He called the mosque in Queens and left threatening messages, and when a door was smashed in, the man was also the culprit, the authorities said. Then, early one morning in 2012, prosecutors said, the same man waited as a worshiper unlocked the mosque’s front door and then stabbed the worshiper repeatedly.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/15/nyregion/15HATE/15HATE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/15/nyregion/15HATE/15HATE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/15/nyregion/15HATE/15HATE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/15/nyregion/15HATE/15HATE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 848, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/15/nyregion/15HATE/15HATE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 6