-4387-5e03-adbd-dd5404921c78'}, {'abstract': 'Jane Dickson’s subway mosaics of Times Square revelers are seen — and photographed — by countless passers-by each day. Now Lens is asking you to stop and take a picture of them.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/12/15/calling-all-party-people-in-times-square/', 'snippet': 'Jane Dickson’s subway mosaics of Times Square revelers are seen — and photographed — by countless passers-by each day. Now Lens is asking you to stop and take a picture of them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jane Dickson just can’t get away from Times Square. She started out as a designer working the big animated billboard in the 1970’s, participated in the groundbreaking Times Square art show in 1980 and finally moved there in 1981 with her husband, the filmmaker Charlie Ahearn. One New Year’s Eve soon afterwards, the artist was pregnant and cooped up in her loft. Against advice — and maybe common sense — she braved the growing crowds and went out to photographs the revelers. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Calling All Party People in Times Square', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New Year', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dickson, Jane', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Instagram Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Times Square and 42nd Street (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-15T09:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Gonzalez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename