': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Alexander', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Burns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7888b043-92b3-5b46-8286-ac68ca2e6b0d', 'word_count': 1210, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7888b043-92b3-5b46-8286-ac68ca2e6b0d'}, {'abstract': 'Family members and friends of the nine victims of the massacre at Emanuel A.M.E. Church have endured the defendant’s trial with stoicism and grace.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/15/us/dylann-roof-trial-charleston-church-killings.html', 'snippet': 'Family members and friends of the nine victims of the massacre at Emanuel A.M.E. Church have endured the defendant’s trial with stoicism and grace.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLESTON, S.C. — Each morning they flowed into Courtroom Six, escorted by federal officials from a holding room reserved for survivors and families of the victims. The accused, Dylann S. Roof, never turned from the end of the defense table to acknowledge the parents, widows and widowers, children, grandchildren and fellow congregants of the nine African-Americans he confessed to killing in June 2015 at Emanuel African Methodist Episcopal Church.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/16/us/15families-2/15families-2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/16/us/15families-2/15families-2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/16/us/15families-2/15families-2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name'