 of childhood injections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/15/well/family/lidocaine-numbs-the-pain-of-infant-shots.html', 'snippet': 'A lidocaine swab can be an easy and effective way to ease the pain of childhood injections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A bit of sugar on the tongue may help distract a baby from the pain of an injection, and cuddling and cooing probably helps, too. But according to a new study, the most effective way to reduce the infant’s pain is to apply lidocaine cream at the injection site as well.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/18/well/18well_pog_vaccs/well_pog_vaccs-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/06/18/well/18well_pog_vaccs/well_pog_vaccs-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/18/well/18well_pog_vaccs/well_pog_vaccs-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 512, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/18/well/18well_pog_vaccs/well_pog_vaccs-superJumbo-v2.png', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/06/18/well/18well_pog_vaccs/well_pog_vaccs-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/06/18/well/18well_pog_vaccs/well_pog_vaccs-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url