 “His Royal Hipness Lord Buckley,” but without the pith helmet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/15/theater/his-royal-hipness-lord-buckley-review.html', 'snippet': 'Jake Broder brings the decades-gone comedian back to slang-slinging life in “His Royal Hipness Lord Buckley,” but without the pith helmet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Few things age as fast as slang — just imagine a play entirely in Valley Girl-ese. At least it could bank on familiarity, which is not the case with “His Royal Hipness Lord Buckley,” a show built on the half-forgotten verbal quirks of an entirely forgotten personality from the 1940s and ’50s. Dig the swinging world of the hip? Solid!', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/16/arts/16ROYALHIP/16ROYALHIP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/16/arts/16ROYALHIP/16ROYALHIP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/16/arts/16ROYALHIP/16ROYALHIP-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/16/arts/16ROYALHIP/16ROYALHIP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/16/arts/16ROYALHIP/16ROYALHIP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/16/arts/16ROYALHIP/16ROYALHIP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 704, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 