 year that it had run out of money and would not return.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s another way that 2016 feels like a break in the space-time continuum: The Big Apple Circus tents are absent from Lincoln Center this holiday season. After almost four decades, the nonprofit announced in July that it had run out of money, and that a desperate $2 million fund-raising drive had fallen woefully short. Which means there are a lot of sad clowns out there. Children who dream of running away to join the circus will have to Google another roadshow.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ALBUM1/18ALBUM1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ALBUM1/18ALBUM1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ALBUM1/18ALBUM1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ALBUM1/18ALBUM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ALBUM1/18ALBUM1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ALBUM1/18ALBUM1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ALBUM1/18ALB