n spends much of her weekends during the holiday season with 35 other high-kicking dancers onstage at Radio City Music Hall. The “Christmas Spectacular Starring the Radio City Rockettes,” which runs through Jan. 2, offers up to five shows on Sundays alone, several featuring Ms. Morgan, 31. She grew up in Highland Park, N.J., where she studied dance under Mary Frangione, a former Rockette, and later graduated with honors from the Ailey/Fordham B.F.A. dance program. She lives in Manhattan with her husband, Edouard Darres, and their dog, Lula.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ROUTINE4/18ROUTINE4-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ROUTINE4/18ROUTINE4-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ROUTINE4/18ROUTINE4-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ROUTINE4/18ROUTINE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ROUTINE4/18ROUTINE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/nyregion/18ROUTINE4/18ROUTINE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/