al': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ea69f3b-03e2-5f13-97a5-1716a39b9a34', 'word_count': 49, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ea69f3b-03e2-5f13-97a5-1716a39b9a34'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the day for Wednesday, December 16, 2016.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/15/pageoneplus/quote-of-the-day.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Wednesday, December 16, 2016.', 'lead_paragraph': '“You can indict 400 people. They don’t care.””', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-12-16T02:07:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba074b72-73ce-5848-8b3b-d386e945df4e', 'word_count': 39, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba074b72-73ce-5848-8b3b-d386e945df4e'}, {'abstract': 'This all-male troupe, on point, merges the absurd and the adorable, as it has for decades on stages around the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/15/arts/dance/review-the-trocks-delight-with-fabulous-charm.html', 'snippet': 'This all-male troupe, on point, merges the absurd and the adorable, as it has for decades on stages around the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ballet is a completely absurd art — and we love it to pieces: that’s what Les Ballets Trockadero de Monte Carlo proclaims with every move. The divas and cavaliers of this all-male troupe are — as they present themselves to us in performance — fabulously stupid, artificial, hammy, clichéd, superficial, dated, monstrous. But they simply adore dancing and their audiences, even more than they love makeup and costumes. So, while you laugh at their demented antics, you find yourself watching them with a special tenderness. You’re on their side.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/15/arts/15TROCKS1/15TROCKS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/15/arts/15TROCKS1/15TROCKS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/15/arts/15TROCKS1/15TROCKS1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/15/arts/15TROCKS1/15TROCKS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/15/arts/15TROCKS1/15TROCKS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/15/arts/15TROCKS1/15TROCKS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/15/arts/15TROCKS1/15TROCKS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1351, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: The Trocks Delight With Fabulous Charm', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Tutus and Chest Hair', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Les Ballets Trockadero de Monte Carlo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Joyce T