e8d-51a9-82c4-372614ab0d18'}, {'abstract': 'He needs a jolt several times a day, and he gives it back to you. It’s a dangerous codependency.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/16/opinion/the-narcotic-of-trump.html', 'snippet': 'He needs a jolt several times a day, and he gives it back to you. It’s a dangerous codependency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You would think forcing Mitt Romney to eat frog legs, while swallowing his dignity, would have been enough humiliation during the dinner segment of his failed tryout for secretary of state. You would think.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/16/opinion/16eganWeb/16eganWeb-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/16/opinion/16eganWeb/16eganWeb-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/16/opinion/16eganWeb/16eganWeb-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/16/opinion/16eganWeb/16eganWeb-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/16/opinion/16eganWeb/16eganWeb-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/16/opinion/16eganWeb/16eganWeb-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 643, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/16/opinion/16eganWeb/16ega