ts are rising on sites once occupied by parking garages, retail buildings and a rowhouse. In one case, development is topping an existing rental building.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/16/realestate/new-luxury-residential-development-upper-west-side.html', 'snippet': 'Projects are rising on sites once occupied by parking garages, retail buildings and a rowhouse. In one case, development is topping an existing rental building.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bordered by two of the city’s largest parks, with some of its best schools and a wealth of good transportation options, homes on the Upper West Side are typically in high demand. The only thing missing — at least in the eyes of developers — has been land to build on.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/realestate/18HIGHEND2/18HIGHEND2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/18/realestate/18HIGHEND2/18HIGHEND2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/realestate/18HIGHEND2/18HIGHEND2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/realestate/18HIGHEND2/18HIGHEND2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/18/realestate/18HIGHEND2/18HIGHEND2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/realestate/18HIGHEND2/18HIGHEND2-jumbo.jpg