ole': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'briefing', '_id': 'nyt://article/bbe387f6-2135-5e90-bc47-55a0216ff124', 'word_count': 825, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bbe387f6-2135-5e90-bc47-55a0216ff124'}, {'abstract': 'More than 30 teams of filmmakers have turned up to document the protests, the Sioux say, and some are neither Native American nor all that respectful.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/16/movies/standing-rock-sioux-tribe-filmmakers.html', 'snippet': 'More than 30 teams of filmmakers have turned up to document the protests, the Sioux say, and some are neither Native American nor all that respectful.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the Standing Rock protest against the Dakota Access Pipeline has gone from bad to worse to hopeful to tentative, dozens of documentarians have descended on the Sioux reservation — 34 teams, according to the tribal database. And while it’s no longer uncommon for major news events to attract multiple filmmakers, some members of the horde in North Dakota seemed to need a lesson in where they were.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/17/arts/17STANDINGROCKFILMS/17STANDINGROCKFILMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/17/arts/17STANDINGROCKFILMS/17STANDINGROCKFILMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/17/arts/17STANDINGROCKFILMS/17STANDINGROCKFILMS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/17/arts/17STANDINGROCK