ika-graswald-kayak-death-case-interrogation-video.html', 'snippet': 'Jurors will be able to watch almost all of an 11-hour video of the police questioning Angelika Graswald, who is charged with the 2015 murder of her fiancé.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GOSHEN, N.Y. — The judge in the case of a woman accused of killing her fiancé during a kayak outing will allow jurors to watch virtually all of an 11-hour police interrogation video in which the defendant, Angelika Graswald, makes a series of incriminating statements.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/nyregion/11KAYAK/11KAYAK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/11/nyregion/11KAYAK/11KAYAK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/nyregion/11KAYAK/11KAYAK-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/nyregion/11KAYAK/11KAYAK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 484, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/11/nyregion/11KAYAK/11KAYAK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 484, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Kayak Death Case, Jury Will See Police Interrogation Video', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jury Will See Interrogation Video in Kayak Death Case, Judge Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations