 department of the Community Medical Center in Toms River, N.J.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bridget Catherine Dries, the daughter of Nancy M. Dries and Robert C. Dries Sr. of Millburn, N.J., was married Dec. 17 to Bryan Jeffrey Georgiana, a son of Karen E. Gecht and Jeffrey F. Georgiana. The Rev. Christopher Beirne, a Roman Catholic priest, performed the ceremony at the Chapel of the Immaculate Conception at Seton Hall University in South Orange, N.J.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/fashion/weddings/18DRIES/18DRIES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/18/fashion/weddings/18DRIES/18DRIES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/fashion/weddings/18DRIES/18DRIES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/fashion/weddings/18DRIES/18DRIES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/18/fashion/weddings/18DRIES/18DRIES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 354}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/fashion/weddings/18DRIES/18DRIES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 605, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/18/fashion/weddings/18DRIES/18DRIES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1210, 'width': 2048, 's