el in Paris, is directed by Caleb Hammond and is partly a sensory experiment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/18/theater/review-mytho-lure-of-wildness-teases-the-senses.html', 'snippet': 'The work, a trip through Anna Kohler’s memories of being a young nude model in Paris, is directed by Caleb Hammond and is partly a sensory experiment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pale flesh is the first thing we see, examined at very near range by the eye of a video camera. In the opening moments of Anna Kohler’s “Mytho? Lure of Wildness,” it roves over breasts and belly as a fingertip touches this body, which is neither firm nor svelte.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/19/arts/19MYTHO/19MYTHO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/19/arts/19MYTHO/19MYTHO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/19/arts/19MYTHO/19MYTHO-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/19/arts/19MYTHO/19MYTHO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/19/arts/19MYTHO/19MYTHO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/19/arts/19MYTHO/19MYTHO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/19/a