.com/2016/12/19/nyregion/gina-quattrochi-who-helped-provide-housing-for-aids-patients-dies-at-63.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Quattrochi served for 25 years as the AIDS Resource Center’s chief executive and was instrumental in building what became the nation’s largest housing resource for people living with AIDS.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gina Quattrochi, who turned Bailey House into the nation’s largest provider of housing to people with AIDS and a model for similar organizations around the United States, died on Dec. 13 in Manhattan. She was 63.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/22/nyregion/22quattrochi-obit/20quattrochi-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 868, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/22/nyregion/22quattrochi-obit/20quattrochi-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 868}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/22/nyregion/22quattrochi-obit/20quattrochi-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 708, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/22/nyregion/22quattrochi-obit/20quattrochi-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1416, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/22/nyregion/22quattrochi-obit/20quattrochi-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/22/nyregion/22quattrochi-obit/20quattrochi-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumb