r special education services that Success Academy may not have provided. The network denied the audit’s findings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/19/nyregion/success-academy-audit.html', 'snippet': 'The comptroller’s office accused the city’s largest charter school network of billing for special education services that Success Academy may not have provided. The network denied the audit’s findings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A financial audit released on Monday by Comptroller Scott M. Stringer said that Success Academy, New York City’s largest charter school operator, was lax in its oversight and record keeping and understated its administrative costs while billing the Education Department for special education services it could not document were delivered.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/20/nyregion/20SUCCESS1/20SUCCESS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/20/nyregion/20SUCCESS1/20SUCCESS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/20/nyregion/20SUCCESS1/20SUCCESS1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/20/nyregion/20SUCCESS1/20SUCCESS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/20/nyregion/20SUCCESS1/20SUCCESS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/20/nyregion/20SU