0/travel/standout-restaurants-strip-malls-los-angeles-california.html', 'snippet': 'Los Angeles’s strip malls have long been strongholds of splendid traditional ethnic restaurants. Now they are home to ultracreative ones, helmed by daring new chefs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I lived in, and loved, Los Angeles for about nine years, so I can get away with saying this: Very little is more Los Angeles than a strip mall. These asphalt-dominated bastions of cheapness and parking sum up so much about what I love and hate about the city. They’re ugly and kitschy, yet they leave room for weird, unexpected, often wonderful surprises, hidden right under your nose.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/travel/25CHOICETABLES4/25CHOICETABLES4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/25/travel/25CHOICETABLES4/25CHOICETABLES4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/travel/25CHOICETABLES4/25CHOICETABLES4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/travel/25CHOICETABLES4/25CHOICETABLES4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/travel/25CHOICETABLES4/25CHOICETABLES4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/25/travel/25CHOICETABLES4/25CHOICETABLES4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight':