'The ride-hailing service has racked up impressive growth, and it has claimed a big share of the market. That could mean capturing more customers might be harder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/20/business/dealbook/uber-aims-to-be-more-than-a-people-mover.html', 'snippet': 'The ride-hailing service has racked up impressive growth, and it has claimed a big share of the market. That could mean capturing more customers might be harder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Uber Technologies could encounter a bumpy ride into public markets. The ride-hailing service has spent the last several years racking up impressive growth. It also has raised easily at least $15 billion, in the process inflating its value to about $68 billion on paper. That will make the next round, possibly in a 2017 initial public offering, tougher.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Uber Aims to Be More Than a People Mover', 'kicker': 'Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Driverless and Semiautonomous Vehicles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Uber Technologies Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-20T20:56:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Cyran', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cyran', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9680856a-20d6-55e7-80a5-debfea08bcf7', 'word_count': 379, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9680856a-20d6-55e7-80a5-debfea08bcf7'}, {'abstract': 'Paraquat, one of many pesticides that can’t be used in Europe but is sold in the United States