Fassbender plays a convict who experiences the actions of his assassin ancestor in this time-bending film based on the video game of the same name.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/20/movies/assassins-creed-review-michael-fassbender.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Fassbender plays a convict who experiences the actions of his assassin ancestor in this time-bending film based on the video game of the same name.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The schlock-cinema connoisseur Michael Weldon once described a particularly logy Roger Corman picture as “70 minutes of ‘Huh?!’” The new sci-fi film “Assassin’s Creed,” based on the popular video game series, is 70 plus 46 minutes of “Huh?”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/21/arts/21ASSASSINJP/21ASSASSINJP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/21/arts/21ASSASSINJP/21ASSASSINJP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/21/arts/21ASSASSINJP/21ASSASSINJP-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/21/arts/21ASSASSINJP/21ASSASSINJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/21/arts/21ASSASSINJP/21ASSASSINJP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/21/arts/21ASSASSINJP/21ASSASSINJP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jum