ndictment of the three says.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/21/nyregion/us-charges-3-with-bribery-involving-new-york-state-pension-fund.html', 'snippet': 'Cocaine and trips were among lures accepted by a portfolio manager of a New York State employee retirement portfolio, an indictment of the three says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A former portfolio manager who was responsible for investing $53 billion in New York State employee retirement funds took over $100,000 in bribes in exchange for steering more than $2 billion in fixed-income business to two brokers, earning them and their firms millions of dollars in commissions, federal authorities said on Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Official Took Bribes to Steer Pension Funds to Brokers, U.S. Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bribery Charge for Pension Fund Official', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pensions and Retirement Plans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York State Common Retirement Fund', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kang, Navnoor', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-21T17:12:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Weiser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8fdc3db6-fff9-5904-a0e5-b702c63ec466', 'word_count': 774, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8fdc3db6-fff9-5904-a0e5-b702c63ec466'}, {'abstract': 'American musicals and Goya paintings inspired the visuals in this J. A. Bayona film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/21/movies/the-imagination-of-a-monster-calls.html', 'snippet': 'American musicals and Goya paintings inspired the visuals in this J. A. Bayona film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'J. A. Bayona has made a specialty of slyly inserting family dramas into genre films. This Spanish filmmaker spun a creepy horror movie with a family drama at its center for his first feature, “The Orphanage.” And he staged a destructive tsunami that pulls a family apart (and together) in the thriller “The Impossible.” In “A Monster Calls,” in theaters Friday, Dec. 23, he returns to family drama again, this time mixing in fantasy to tell the story of how the 12-year-old Conor copes with his mother’s terminal illness when he is visited by a treelike monster.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25MONSTER-CALL2/25MONSTER-CALL2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25MONSTER-CALL2/25MONSTER-CALL2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25MONSTER-CALL2/25MONSTER-CALL2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25MONSTER-CALL2/25MONSTER-CALL2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25MONSTER-CALL2/25MONST