’t everything, it’s not worth a single hour of someone’s trouble.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The author of “Middle Passage” and, most recently, “The Way of the Writer” agrees with Sartre: “If literature isn’t everything, it’s not worth a single hour of someone’s trouble.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/books/review/1225-BKS-ByTheBook/1225-BKS-ByTheBook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/25/books/review/1225-BKS-ByTheBook/1225-BKS-ByTheBook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/books/review/1225-BKS-ByTheBook/1225-BKS-ByTheBook-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/books/review/1225-BKS-ByTheBook/1225-BKS-ByTheBook-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 798, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/25/books/review/1225-BKS-ByTheBook/1225-BKS-ByTheBook-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 798}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/books/review/1225-BKS-ByTheBook/1225-BKS-ByTheBook-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 771, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/books/review/1225-BKS-ByTheBook/1225-BKS-ByTheBook-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1541, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Charles Johnson: By the Book', 'kicker': 'By the Book', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Charles Johnson', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Charles R (1948- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-22T11:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7d7f423-d421-54fb-ab09-928cb6536d48', 'word_count': 2042, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7d7f423-d421-54fb-ab09-928cb6536d48'}, {'abstract': 'In 2016, the industry’s evolution and embrace of streaming has encouraged listeners’ curiosity as artists have become experimental and adventurous.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/22/arts/music/streaming-album-bon-iver-kanye-west-frank-ocean.html', 'snippet': 'In 2016, the industry’s evolution and embrace of streaming has encouraged listeners’ curiosity as artists have become experimental and adventurous.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Something unexpected happened near the top of the album charts this year: Pop stars were acting like artists. That is to say, they weren’t desperately chasing the broadest possible audience with the most surefire formulas; they weren’t calculating what would fit radio formats best. Instead, some of them grew eccentric and adventurous, impulsive and experimental, instinctive and personal — at times, bordering on avant-garde. And they found that listeners were willing to pay attention.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25STREAMING/25STREAMING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1133, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25STREAMING/25STREAMING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1133}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25STREAMING/25STREAMING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 543, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25STREAMING/25STREAMING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1086, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25STREAMING/25STREAMING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25STREAMING/25STREAMING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/arts/25STREAMING/25STREAMING-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Streaming, Musicians and Fans Find Room to Experiment and Explore', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Year of Poetry and Power, Bit by Bit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Audio Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adele (Singer)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bowie, David', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Knowles, Beyonce', 'rank': 6, 'major