stract': 'Anthony was criticized in excerpts from a book by George Karl, his former coach. He then went out against the Magic and had one of his worst games of the season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/22/sports/basketball/ny-knicks-orlando-magic-carmelo-anthony.html', 'snippet': 'Anthony was criticized in excerpts from a book by George Karl, his former coach. He then went out against the Magic and had one of his worst games of the season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is not that fun to be Carmelo Anthony these days. It should be, of course. He is in the midst of a possibly rare season: one that ends in a playoff appearance for the Knicks. He has emerged as a spokesman not just for the team, but for the N.B.A. And he finally has help: With Kristaps Porzingis and Derrick Rose, Anthony is no longer the lone star in the Knicks’ universe.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/23/sports/23knicks-web/23knicks-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/23/sports/23knicks-web/23knicks-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/23/sports/23knicks-web/23knicks-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/23/sports/23knicks-web/23knicks-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/23/sports/23knicks-web/23knicks-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumb