ate scientist who flew to the International Space Station three times in NASA’s shuttle program, became a leading figure in the agency’s scientific research initiatives and continued while terminally ill to devote himself to the challenges posed by global warming, died on Friday in Houston. He was 61.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/us/25SELLERS-obit/25SELLERS-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/25/us/25SELLERS-obit/25SELLERS-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/us/25SELLERS-obit/25SELLERS-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/us/25SELLERS-obit/25SELLERS-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/25/us/25SELLERS-obit/25SELLERS-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/us/25SELLERS-obit/25SELLERS-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/us/25SELLERS-obit/25SELLERS-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Piers J. Sellers, Climate Scientist and Space Station Astronaut, Dies at 61', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Piers J. Sellers, 61, Astronaut Who Studied Climate Change', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goldstein, Richard', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sellers, Piers J (1955-2016)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Aeronautics and Space Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Space and Astronomy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goddard Space Flight Center', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-24T14:36:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Goldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/1008e42b-fc9d-5fc9-82e6-c6251626fe9e', 'word_count': 618, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1008e42b-fc9d-5fc9-82e6-c6251626fe9e'}, {'abstract': 'In a dog-friendly co-op, can the board evict a breed with a bad reputation?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/24/realestate/when-a-neighbor-brings-home-a-pit-bull.html', 'snippet': 'In a dog-friendly co-op, can the board evict a breed with a bad reputation?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q. I am the president of the board of a co-op in East Harlem, Manhattan, that permits dogs of any size or breed. But after a rental tenant  got a pit bull, the board received several complaints from residents who say the dog whines and pounds the floor. One is terrified of the breed and complains almost daily, calling for the dog to be removed. What am I supposed to do? I don’t think the dog can be removed just because of the stereotypes surrounding its breed. But how do I tell the pet owner that she must keep her dog quiet?', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/realestate/25ASK/25ASK-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 120, 'width': 591, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/realestate/25ASK/25ASK-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 120, 'width': 591, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/realestate/25ASK/25ASK-thumbStandard-v7.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/25/realestate/25ASK/25ASK-thumbStandard-v7.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/25/realestate/25ASK/25ASK-thumbLarge-v6.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When a Neighbor Brings Home a Pit Bull', 'kicker': 'Ask Real Estate', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Tenant’s Pit Bull Is Noisy.  What Can a Co-op Board Do?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dogs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooperatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Harlem (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major':