 'uri': 'nyt://article/bab2ad8c-ec41-5789-bb62-b7abf356dc60'}, {'abstract': 'Getting in shape in January is a tradition. But some properties are offering long-term wellness programs, including yoga and guided runs and hikes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/27/travel/fitness-resolutions-year-round-hotel-plans.html', 'snippet': 'Getting in shape in January is a tradition. But some properties are offering long-term wellness programs, including yoga and guided runs and hikes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A new year, a new opportunity to get healthy: Resolutions to exercise more and eat right are popular come Jan. 1. With all of these intentions in mind, hotels typically offer limited-time fitness- and nutrition-themed packages to attract guests for stays during the first few months of the year. This year, however, some properties are changing their approach by introducing wellness programs and packages that travelers can take advantage of at any time.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/01/01/travel/01UPDATE/01UPDATE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/01/01/travel/01UPDATE/01UPDATE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/01/01/travel/01UPDATE/01UPDATE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/01/01/travel/01UPDATE/01UPDATE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/01/01/travel/01UPDATE/01UPDATE-articleLarge.jpg', '