rlaux Brut Grande Cuvée nonvintage, $43 for 750 milliliters, Vintry Fine Wines, 230 Murray Street (West Street), 888-686-8767, vintryfinewines.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE/28BURNER-CHAMPAGNE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Champagne for the New Year', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Toast: Now, in a Starring Role, Pinot Meunier', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Champagne (Wine)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Arlaux SAS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-12-27T14:40:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f54ad963-7a87-5cb6-8f13-910f1d5018bc', 'word_count': 117, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f54ad963-7a87-5cb6-8f13-910f1d5018bc'}, {'abstract': 'With its low-slung buildings and vacant parcels, the River North Art District is seen as one of the last development frontiers in the city.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/27/realestate/commercial/denvers-gritty-back-door-could-become-its-new-gateway.html', 'snippet': 'With its low-slung buildings and vacant parcels, the River North Art District is seen as one of the last development frontiers in the city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DENVER — A checkerboard of low-slung buildings and vacant parcels, the River North Art District in this fast-growing city has developed a funky vibe over the last few years.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/business/28denversqft1/28denversqft1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/28/business/28denversqft1/28denversqft1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit'