1a01483'}, {'abstract': 'A pasta sauce and a garlic dip from Delicious & Sons are ready for entertaining.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/27/dining/delicious-and-sons-aioli-and-truffle-sauce.html', 'snippet': 'A pasta sauce and a garlic dip from Delicious & Sons are ready for entertaining.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Store shelves are lined with sauces and spreads galore, and newcomers show up all the time. This unusual aioli and a dusky blend of mushrooms and black truffles from a new company, Delicious & Sons, get a thumbs up. Use the orange-scented aioli straight from the jar with seafood or a paella. Toss pappardelle in the mushroom-truffle mix, thinned with a little pasta water: Delicious & Sons, 6.35-ounce jars, deliciousandsons.com, garlic aioli with saffron and orange, $8.95; black truffle and mushroom sauce, $12.35, amazon.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-DELICIOUS/28BURNER-DELICIOUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-DELICIOUS/28BURNER-DELICIOUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-DELICIOUS/28BURNER-DELICIOUS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-DELICIOUS/28BURNER-DELICIOUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 462, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/28/dining/28BURNER-DELICIOUS/28BURNER-DELICIOUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth':