menca.html', 'snippet': 'Noche Flamenca, the dance troupe led by Soledad Barrio, opened its latest season with blends of flamenco, dance theater and hip-hop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Noche Flamenca, the beloved flamenco troupe, can eschew spectacle and concepts for a simple presentation, because it can rely on its dependably thrilling star, Soledad Barrio. In recent years, though, the group has grown a little more theatrically ambitious, and a new pattern has emerged: longer works that take a season or two to find their footing.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/arts/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/28/arts/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/arts/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/arts/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/28/arts/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/28/arts/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB/28NOCHEFLAMENCA-WEB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capt