'abstract': 'Best friends have your back no matter what — especially when they’re court ordered.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/29/magazine/judge-john-hodgman-on-forced-friendships.html', 'snippet': 'Best friends have your back no matter what — especially when they’re court ordered.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Taylor writes: I believe that my roommate Zoe and I could be friends. But even though she lives in my house, I don’t know how to approach her. It’s a big house, and we live at opposite ends. Still, she seems cool and I’d like to get to know her better. I think she would be more convinced if you told her to give it a try. Please order Zoe to be my friend.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/01/01/magazine/01hodgman/01mag-01hodgman-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 589, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2017/01/01/magazine/01hodgman/01mag-01hodgman-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 589}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/01/01/magazine/01hodgman/01mag-01hodgman-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1005, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/01/01/magazine/01hodgman/01mag-01hodgman-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1244, 'width': 1268, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2017/01/01/magazine/01hodgman/01mag-01hodgman-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2017/01/01/magazine/01hodgman/01mag-