as Smith’s colossal biography shows Grigory Rasputin as a man of influence during the twilight of the Romanov dynasty, but neither sinner nor saint.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/12/29/books/rasputin-biography-douglas-smith.html', 'snippet': 'Douglas Smith’s colossal biography shows Grigory Rasputin as a man of influence during the twilight of the Romanov dynasty, but neither sinner nor saint.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From the opening pages of his colossal biography of Grigory Rasputin, the historian Douglas Smith dismantles many of the myths enshrouding the monk who exerted inordinate influence over Nicholas II and Alexandra, emperor and empress of Russia, during the twilight of the Romanov dynasty a century ago.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/30/arts/30booksmith2/30booksmith2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 844, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/12/30/arts/30booksmith2/30booksmith2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 844}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/30/arts/30booksmith2/30booksmith2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 928, 'width': 660, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/30/arts/30booksmith2/30booksmith2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 928, 'width': 660, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/12/30/arts/30booksmith2/30booksmith2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/12/30/arts/30books